{"steam_appid":5200620,"steam_name":"Dungeonbound","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/5200620/133920481/92c1b1b2e6b9ec23e1af134dc96c06ddfc858558/1792538585/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1792541451","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257458037/2f3e14f5daf1bc3426fbdfde45210828dc8cbcc6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1792541451","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/b3f73bb8dc9cd8359443fa0b097eb2a428310fb2/ss_b3f73bb8dc9cd8359443fa0b097eb2a428310fb2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/58c2f3ecc5440202c4cbf5890ee14df3f525306f/ss_58c2f3ecc5440202c4cbf5890ee14df3f525306f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/729d78262dcbdf52d7194f282d0e857bd3551b3e/ss_729d78262dcbdf52d7194f282d0e857bd3551b3e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/656df4f048585c05fc00d707296909104b66f7a3/ss_656df4f048585c05fc00d707296909104b66f7a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794984507","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/aec9225bdb327f72bd7bb5173ca389be544e7724/ss_aec9225bdb327f72bd7bb5173ca389be544e7724.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794984507"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/fc4138b7751d66fbdd0ea4f18b5f98b2.poster.avif?t=1794984507\" width=616 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/fc4138b7751d66fbdd0ea4f18b5f98b2.webm?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/fc4138b7751d66fbdd0ea4f18b5f98b2.mp4?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeonbound is a roguelike autobattler about your inventory. Every item is a piece on a grid and where you put it changes what it does. At the forge you can fuse any two items into a brand new one that keeps the powers of both. Buy, forge and curse your gear to put together the craziest build you can, then watch it fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/c27712c00737a8120e0e4cc73e3c0562.poster.avif?t=1794984507\" width=616 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/c27712c00737a8120e0e4cc73e3c0562.webm?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/c27712c00737a8120e0e4cc73e3c0562.mp4?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rivals you face are the builds of other players. Beat them to keep climbing and your own build goes into the pool for someone else to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/7c87201cb87bd6dfed0c1fad5d85b67b.poster.avif?t=1794984507\" width=616 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/7c87201cb87bd6dfed0c1fad5d85b67b.webm?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/7c87201cb87bd6dfed0c1fad5d85b67b.mp4?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village was burned and you are out for revenge. Go alone or bring up to 3 friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/a2ae65fd78c01a5d9964972188e029f5.poster.avif?t=1794984507\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/a2ae65fd78c01a5d9964972188e029f5.webm?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/a2ae65fd78c01a5d9964972188e029f5.mp4?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 heroes to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >740 items and 100 relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse any two items into one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for 2 to 4 players and a Versus mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked, daily climbs and leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incremental campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mods, controller support and Steam Deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/7a761611b67f9f9f5b9e65939516e787.poster.avif?t=1794984507\" width=616 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/7a761611b67f9f9f5b9e65939516e787.webm?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/7a761611b67f9f9f5b9e65939516e787.mp4?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/ab476f86e27e3a2137d9160e80e1512f.poster.avif?t=1794984507\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/ab476f86e27e3a2137d9160e80e1512f.webm?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5200620/extras/ab476f86e27e3a2137d9160e80e1512f.mp4?t=1794984507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Integrated graphics (e.g., Intel HD Graphics) or equivalent; dedicated GPU not necessary<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG","Strategy"],"developers":["louidev"],"publishers":["louidev"],"release_date":"Nov 16, 2026"}